</pre></div>
<p>Which will show <a href="/scp-173">SCP-173</a>. And to change the text of the link, you can do this:</p>
<div class="code">
<pre>
<code>[[[scp-426|that damn toaster]]]</code>
</pre></div>
<p>so it links to <a href="/scp-426">that damn toaster</a>.</p>

